<title>USA: MBIA has limited capacity for secondary insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA has limited capacity for secondary insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Tuesday it has limited capacity in the following names on a first-come first served basis.</p>
<p>--Local Government Assistance Corp (LGAC)</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico Highways</p>
<p>--New York City GOs.</p>
<p>--Denver Airports</p>
<p>--Puerto Rico EPAs</p>
<p>Please call 1-800-MBIA-NOW for latest prices.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
